{"id":"wb-4-226","name":"上海邮政总局","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"上海邮政总局","text":"上海邮政总局位于中华人民共和国上海市北苏州路276号。大楼始建于1924年，造价为320万银元。由当时沪上英商思九生洋行负责设计，上海余洪记营造厂负责营建。大楼拥有号称“远东第一大厅”的邮政营业厅，现在为中国邮政集团公司上海市分公司和四川路桥邮政支局所在地。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E9%82%AE%E6%94%BF%E6%80%BB%E5%B1%80","revisionId":93372790,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93372790","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/128b985002e0c92d56bd39cb.jpg","title":"Shanghai_Postal_Museum_in_May_2016.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Shanghai_Postal_Museum_in_May_2016.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/63/Shanghai_Postal_Museum_in_May_2016.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Shanghai Postal Museum (General Post Office Building)","width":320,"height":213}}